{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "治理与密钥",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 93.3,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "许可链最大的风险，常常在流程里。",
   "spoken": "许可链最大的风险，常常在流程里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.608
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "第一处，根 CA。",
   "spoken": "第一处，根 CA。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 5.02,
   "dur": 2.24,
   "speechStart": 5.118,
   "speechEnd": 7.019
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "根私钥放在在线服务器上，一旦被攻破，攻击者就能签发任意身份。",
   "spoken": "根私钥放在在线服务器上，一旦被攻破，攻击者就能签发任意身份。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 7.48,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 7.579,
   "speechEnd": 13.45
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "控制是根 CA 离线，私钥放进 HSM，日常签发交给中间 CA。",
   "spoken": "控制是根 CA 离线，私钥放进 HSM，日常签发交给中间 CA。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 13.86,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 13.959,
   "speechEnd": 19.515
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "节点和管理员的私钥，也放进 HSM 或 KMS。",
   "spoken": "节点和管理员的私钥，也放进 HSM 或 KMS。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 19.92,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 20.013,
   "speechEnd": 24.352
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "身份 CA 和 TLS CA，也要分开。",
   "spoken": "身份 CA 和 TLS CA，也要分开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 24.78,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 24.78,
   "speechEnd": 28.562
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "第二处，管理员集中。",
   "spoken": "第二处，管理员集中。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 29.0,
   "dur": 1.84,
   "speechStart": 29.094,
   "speechEnd": 30.637
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "一家技术服务商，替好几家组织拿着管理员证书。",
   "spoken": "一家技术服务商，替好几家组织拿着管理员证书。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 31.06,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 31.153,
   "speechEnd": 35.058
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "它一出事，好几家就同时失守。",
   "spoken": "它一出事，好几家就同时失守。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 35.44,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 35.44,
   "speechEnd": 38.163
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "控制是各家自持密钥，服务商只拿受限的运维权限。",
   "spoken": "控制是各家自持密钥，服务商只拿受限的运维权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 38.54,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 38.638,
   "speechEnd": 42.83
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "第三处，配置更新和成员退出。",
   "spoken": "第三处，配置更新和成员退出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 43.24,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 43.331,
   "speechEnd": 46.0
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "改通道策略或成员名单，要多家组织签名，变更留痕。",
   "spoken": "改通道策略或成员名单，要多家组织签名，变更留痕。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 46.42,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 46.513,
   "speechEnd": 51.207
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "成员退出时，要吊销证书，修改策略，再评估它手里已经拿到的数据。",
   "spoken": "成员退出时，要吊销证书，修改策略，再评估它手里已经拿到的数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 51.6,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 51.697,
   "speechEnd": 57.491
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "Fabric 文档提醒，成员身份不会自动过期，只能吊销。",
   "spoken": "Fabric 文档提醒，成员身份不会自动过期，只能吊销。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 57.9,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 57.9,
   "speechEnd": 62.191
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "所以吊销流程，要提前演练。",
   "spoken": "所以吊销流程，要提前演练。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 62.6,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 62.697,
   "speechEnd": 65.073
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "第四处，成员共谋。",
   "spoken": "第四处，成员共谋。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 65.54,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 65.54,
   "speechEnd": 67.66
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "达到背书门槛的几家成员，可以写入虚假的业务状态。",
   "spoken": "达到背书门槛的几家成员，可以写入虚假的业务状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 68.08,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 68.173,
   "speechEnd": 72.634
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "对策是外部锚定，定期把账本摘要写到公链，或者交给第三方保存。",
   "spoken": "对策是外部锚定，定期把账本摘要写到公链，或者交给第三方保存。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 73.02,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 73.123,
   "speechEnd": 78.825
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "它能证明历史没被改写，却不能证明数据本身是真的。",
   "spoken": "它能证明历史没被改写，却不能证明数据本身是真的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 79.24,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 79.24,
   "speechEnd": 84.846
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "最后，所有节点放在同一个云账户里，也是单点，要分账户，分地域，分运营方。",
   "spoken": "最后，所有节点放在同一个云账户里，也是单点，要分账户，分地域，分运营方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-19.wav",
   "start": 85.3,
   "dur": 6.8,
   "speechStart": 85.3,
   "speechEnd": 91.873
  }
